LanguageData.PhobosVehicleSystems_CrossFeedDesc:
Each engine draws on the tank on its own side. {SIDES}
Automatic: shut, until a tank runs dry while the other still holds fuel; then the crew opens it. Open: both tanks feed both engines, so neither stops, but a holed tank drains them both. Shut: each engine keeps to its own tank, so a holed tank empties on its own side and that engine stops.
Click to change.
